 tw-h-9 tw-w-14 tw-rounded-lg tw-justify-center tw-flex tw-items-center" style="box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.4), 0 2px 4px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.04)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="tw-size-4"><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v3.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-3.5A.75.75 0 0 1 12 2M4.93 4.929a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0l2.475 2.475a.75.75 0 1 1-1.061 1.06L4.929 5.99a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06m14.142 0a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.061l-2.475 2.475a.75.75 0 0 1-1.061-1.06l2.475-2.476a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0M2 12.001a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-3.5A.75.75 0 0 1 2 12m15 0a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-3.5A.75.75 0 0 1 17 12m-1.464 3.534a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0l2.475 2.475a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 1.06l-2.475-2.474a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06m-7.071.001a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06L5.99 19.073a.75.75 0 1 1-1.06-1.061l2.474-2.475a.75.75 0 0 1 1.061 0M12 17a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v3.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-3.5A.75.75 0 0 1 12 17"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div><h3 class="tw-pointer-events-auto tw-mt-auto tw-type-sm tw-font-medium tw-text-white/80">All-in-one AI editor</h3><p class="tw-pointer-events-auto tw-mt-4.5 tw-type-sm tw-text-pretty tw-text-white">Create podcasts, audiobooks and voiceovers in an editor built on all of ElevenLabs’ audio research combined.</p><div class="tw-absolute tw-pointer-events-none tw-inset-0 tw-ring-0.5 tw-ring-black/7.5 tw-ring-inset tw-z-30 tw-rounded-2.5xl"></div></div></div><div class="tw-group tw-rounded-2.5xl tw-relative tw-overflow-hidden tw-bg-cream tw-h-full tw-isolate tw-col-span-full has-[[data-bento-link]:focus-visible]:tw-outline-focus lg:tw-col-span-6"><div class="tw-h-full tw-relative tw-pointer-events-none tw-px-5 tw-pb-6 sm:tw-px-7 sm:tw-pb-8 tw-flex tw-flex-col"><div class="tw-h-[29.625rem] tw-relative tw-pointer-events-auto [--full-bleed-x:1.25rem] sm:[--full-bleed-x:1.75rem] tw-z-20"><audio preload="none" style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" crossorigin="anonymous"></audio><div class="tw-h-full tw-flex tw-items-center"><div class="-tw-mt-9 tw-relative tw-isolate tw-bg-white tw-rounded-3xl tw-w-full tw-mx-auto tw-ring-0.5 tw-ring-inset tw-ring-gray-200 tw-max-w-[37rem]"><div class=""><div class="tw-relative tw-flex tw-flex-col"><div class="tw-flex-auto tw-overflow-y-auto tw-scroll-pt-4 tw-scroll-pb-6 tw-flex tw-flex-col tw-scrollbar-none tw-h-40"><div class="tw-relative tw-flex-auto tw-flex tw-flex-col"><div class="tw-relative tw-flex-auto"><div class="tw-px-5 tw-text-base/base tw-text-black tw-caret-focus tw-outline-none tw-pt-4" style="white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:break-word" inert="">In the ancient land of Eldoria, where skies shimmered and forests, whispered secrets to the wind, lived a dragon named Zephyros. <span class="tw-text-gray-400">[sarcastically]</span> Not the “burn it all down” kind... <span class="tw-text-gray-400">[giggles]</span> but he was gentle, wise, with eyes like old stars. <span class="tw-text-gray-400">[whispers]</span> Even the birds fell silent when he passed.<!-- -->​</div><textarea class="tw-px-5 tw-text-base/base tw-text-black tw-caret-focus tw-outline-none tw-pt-4" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;resize:none;color:transparent;background-color:transparent" spellCheck="false" aria-label="Enter your text here, ElevenLabs AI Voice Generator will read it for you" maxLength="1000">In the ancient land of Eldoria, where skies shimmered and forests, whispered secrets to the wind, lived a dragon named Zephyros. [sarcastically] Not the “burn it all down” kind... [giggles] but he was gentle, wise, with eyes like old stars. [whispers] Even the birds fell silent when he passed.</textarea></div></div><div class="tw-flex-none tw-sticky tw-bottom-0 tw-h-6 tw-bg-gradient-to-t tw-from-white tw-mx-[0.5px]"></div></div><div class="tw-relative tw-z-10 tw-flex tw-items-center tw-px-3 tw-pb-3"><template><div class="tw-sticky tw-z-50 tw-h-1.5 tw-top-0 -tw-mb-1.5 tw-pointer-events-auto"></div></tem