Terms of Service\u003c/termsLink\u003e. To learn more about how ElevenLabs handles your data, check our \u003cprivacyLink\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/privacyLink\u003e.\"},\"RandomFact\":{\"random_fact_did_you_know\":\"Did you know?\",\"random_fact_1\":\"ElevenLabs was founded in 2022 by Piotr and Mati, who met at a hackathon.\",\"random_fact_2\":\"ElevenLabs can clone a voice from just a few seconds of audio.\",\"random_fact_3\":\"ElevenLabs supports speech generation in 32 languages.\",\"random_fact_4\":\"The Reader app can turn any text — articles, PDFs, books — into audio.\",\"random_fact_5\":\"The Voice Library has thousands of community-created voices you can use.\",\"random_fact_6\":\"The Projects feature can turn entire books into multi-voice audiobooks.\",\"random_fact_7\":\"ElevenLabs' voice AI has been used to dub movies and TV shows across languages.\",\"random_fact_8\":\"The Sound Effects model can generate any sound from a text description.\",\"random_fact_9\":\"ElevenLabs offers a Conversational AI platform to build voice-powered agents.\",\"random_fact_10\":\"The music model can compose original tracks from a text prompt.\"},\"hero_video_showcase\":{\"play_video\":\"Play video: {title}\",\"mute\":\"Mute\",\"unmute\":\"Unmute\"},\"AudioPlayerBar\":{\"play\":\"Play\",\"pause\":\"Pause\",\"edit_prompt\":\"Edit prompt\",\"download\":\"Download\"},\"AudioGenerationWidget\":{\"submit\":\"Submit\",\"minimize\":\"Minimize\",\"generating\":\"Generating...\",\"generate_new\":\"Generate new\",\"sign_up\":\"Sign up\",\"play\":\"Play\",\"pause\":\"Pause\",\"download\":\"Download\",\"generation\":\"Generation {number}\"},\"CategoryExploreList\":{\"generate_cta_button\":\"Generate\",\"generate_footer_button\":\"Generate your own\"},\"MusicGenerationWidget\":{\"create_your_own_music\":\"Create your own music\",\"generate_music\":\"Generate Music\",\"describe_music\":\"Describe the music you want to create...\"},\"MusicExploreList\":{\"generate_your_own_music\":\"Gener